{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>I will bring you up, surely.</b> After I bring you up and take you out from there, you will gain added perfection beyond what you had before you went down there, as it says: וּלְהַעֲלֹתוֹ מִן הָאָרֶץ הַהִיא אֶל אֶרֶץ טוֹבָה (Exodus 3:8)." "<b>He shall put his hand over your eyes.</b> You will not need to keep your eyes open to attend to your needs, for Joseph will bring them to you without your oversight, and you will not need to deal with the Egyptians, who are not worthy to draw near to you."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 46, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:34:52.807542368Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}